    "intro_narrative": "You awaken from cryosleep to the blaring sound of emergency sirens. You are aboard the Helios-7, a derelict orbital research station drifting dangerously close to a dying star. The air is growing thin, and the red emergency lights cast long, ominous shadows along the metallic corridors. Life support systems are rapidly failing, and the station’s structural integrity is compromised by the immense gravitational pull. Your only chance of survival is to initiate the emergency escape pod sequence, but the master launch codes have been locked away inside a highly secure vault by the previous crew. To escape, you must navigate a complex web of interconnected terminals, malfunctioning consoles, and forgotten data logs scattered throughout the facility. You will need to carefully decipher cryptic modules, reroute power systems, and piece together the final sequence through sheer logic. Every device is interconnected, and finding the right order to activate them is paramount. Time is running out as the station groans under the stress of impending gravitational collapse. Will you uncover the correct data flow and unlock the escape pod, or will you become a permanent resident of this cosmic graveyard?",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
